@startuml
actor User
participant WebApp as "React Web Version"
participant Clerk as "Clerk Auth Service"
participant Backend as "FastAPI Gateway"
database Supabase as "Supabase Database"

User -> WebApp : Click Signup
WebApp -> Clerk : Enter details & sign up
Clerk --> WebApp : Successful signup with JWT session
WebApp -> Backend : POST /sync-user (Authorization Bearer Token)
Backend -> Backend : Verify Token and Extract user details (email, id)
Backend -> Supabase : INSERT INTO public.users ON CONFLICT UPDATE
Backend -> Supabase : INSERT INTO public.user_stats (Initialize streaks)
Backend -> Supabase : INSERT INTO public.user_ai_usage_quotas
Backend --> WebApp : Return user plan & active state
@enduml
